      "body": "<div class='grid-bg'></div><div style='position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:46px;padding:0 70px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px'><div class='accent' style='font-size:22px;font-weight:600'>Engineering highlight</div><div class='title' style='font-size:52px'>Hosted checkout, no card data in the app</div></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:12px'><div style='width:318px;min-height:300px;padding:28px 26px;border-radius:24px;background:#ffffff0f;border:1px solid #ffffff22;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px'><div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E6BD8,#F59E0B);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:22px'>1</div><div style='font-size:23px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25'>Tap buy</div><div style='font-size:17px;opacity:.75;line-height:1.45'>Plan, lesson booking, wallet top-up or playlist: each product has its own start endpoint.</div></div><div style='font-size:34px;opacity:.5;align-self:center'>&#8594;</div><div style='width:318px;min-height:300px;padding:28px 26px;border-radius:24px;background:#ffffff0f;border:1px solid #ffffff22;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px'><div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E6BD8,#F59E0B);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:22px'>2</div><div style='font-size:23px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25'>Server signs the URL</div><div style='font-size:17px;opacity:.75;line-height:1.45'>Backend creates a pending purchase and returns a signed checkout link (or auto-confirms).</div></div><div style='font-size:34px;opacity:.5;align-self:center'>&#8594;</div><div style='width:318px;min-height:300px;padding:28px 26px;border-radius:24px;background:#ffffff0f;border:1px solid #ffffff22;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px'><div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E6BD8,#F59E0B);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:22px'>3</div><div style='font-size:23px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25'>Real browser tab</div><div style='font-size:17px;opacity:.75;line-height:1.45'>Custom Tabs / SFSafariViewController, so 3-D Secure and Google Pay work. Not a WebView.</div></div><div style='font-size:34px;opacity:.5;align-self:center'>&#8594;</div><div style='width:318px;min-height:300px;padding:28px 26px;border-radius:24px;background:#ffffff0f;border:1px solid #ffffff22;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px'><div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E6BD8,#F59E0B);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:22px'>4</div><div style='font-size:23px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25'>Deep link back</div><div style='font-size:17px;opacity:.75;line-height:1.45'>HMAC-verified callback, then studygo://payments/result. Polling covers a lost redirect.</div></div></div><div style='font-size:19px;opacity:.6'>Money travels as integer agorot (1/100 ILS), never floats. Diagram drawn from the integration spec; it is not an app screenshot.</div></div>"
